{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A membership for tuned replenishment</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Membership-based sound gatherings and private sessions for focused decompression in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Membership</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta small">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="primary-cta" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" role="banner">
      <div class="pattern-wrap">
        <svg class="hero-pattern" viewBox="0 0 800 200" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <pattern id="p1" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#f9fbfb"></rect>
              <circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6" fill="#e6f3f8"></circle>
              <path d="M0 30 L40 10" stroke="#eef8fb" stroke-width="2"></path>
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)"></rect>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="title">Small-group sound membership for deliberate rest</h1>
          <p class="lead">A membership of monthly gatherings and gentle guided sessions that help you drop the edges of the day and rebuild calm from the inside out.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <button class="primary-cta" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Join the Membership</button>
            <a class="muted" href="events.html">Next public session</a>
          </div>
          <p class="meta">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3>Next: Open Gathering</h3>
          <div class="next-event">
            <div class="date">Sun • Mar 7 • 6:30pm</div>
            <div class="loc">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            <a class="cta" href="events.html">See details</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework container" id="framework">
      <h2>How we structure presence</h2>
      <p class="intro">A simple, repeatable architecture for practice: arrive, attune, and integrate. Sessions are briefed, sonically guided, and closed with a short reintegration—enough to shift nervous tone without overstimulation.</p>

      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>Anchor</h4>
          <p>Minimal guidance to land attention in breath and body.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>Tone</h4>
          <p>Layered instruments tuned to settle the autonomic rhythm.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <h4>Return</h4>
          <p>Short integration practice to carry the calm forward.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story container">
      <h2>A membership that expects gentle progress</h2>
      <p>Members receive weekly gatherings, priority booking for private sessions, and a credit system for guest passes. The model favors gradual regulation over one-off escape.</p>
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>For regulars</h4>
          <p>Attend enough to notice shifts: less reactivity, clearer evenings, steadier sleep starts.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>For the curious</h4>
          <p>Low-friction entry to discover how tuned sound affects your day-to-day baseline.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>For private care</h4>
          <p>Members book reduced-rate private sessions for acute needs or personalized pathways.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="offers container">
      <h2>Programs & naming</h2>
      <p class="small">We frame offerings to match how often you want to return. Language is practical—membership, single gatherings, and private alignments.</p>
      <div class="offer-cards">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Pulse Pass</h3>
          <p>Single-session admission for a focused hour.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="events.html">Reserve a seat</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Flow Membership</h3>
          <p>Monthly gatherings with booking priority and guest credits.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="pricing.html">Explore membership</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Wave Private</h3>
          <p>One-on-one sessions tailored for acute regulation or integration work.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="private-sessions.html">Request private</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing container" id="pricing">
      <h2>Pricing</h2>
      <p class="muted">Toggle between monthly membership and package prices. Animated numbers make differences clear at a glance.</p>

      <div class="comparator">
        <div class="switch">
          <span class="label">Monthly</span>
          <label class="toggle">
            <input id="price-toggle" type="checkbox">
            <span class="knob"></span>
          </label>
          <span class="label">Package</span>
        </div>

        <div class="prices">
          <div class="price-card">
            <h4>Pulse Pass</h4>
            <div class="amount" data-month="25" data-package="20">$25</div>
            <p class="desc">Single-session drop-in</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <h4>Flow Membership</h4>
            <div class="amount" data-month="48" data-package="42">$48</div>
            <p class="desc">Monthly access, priority booking</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <h4>Wave Private</h4>
            <div class="amount" data-month="120" data-package="350">$120</div>
            <p class="desc">Per private session / package</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mood container" id="mood">
      <h2>Mood-to-Method</h2>
      <p class="muted">Select how you feel; we’ll suggest the practice and update the booking call-to-action to match.</p>

      <div class="mood-panel">
        <div class="mood-options" role="list">
          <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="wired">Wired</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="foggy">Foggy</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="heavy">Heavy</button>
          <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="restless">Restless</button>
        </div>

        <div class="mood-recommendation">
          <h3 id="mood-method">Choose a state</h3>
          <p id="mood-desc">Pick an option to see a tailored approach and adapted CTA.</p>
          <div class="mood-actions">
            <button id="mood-cta" class="primary-cta">Plan a session</button>
            <button id="mood-secondary" class="muted">Learn more</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials container">
      <h2>Notes from participants</h2>
      <blockquote>"A steady weekly appointment with myself. It took only a few sessions to notice evenings felt simpler." — J.</blockquote>
      <blockquote>"I book a private Wave when things are frayed. It’s focused and manageable." — R.</blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="cta container">
      <div class="cta-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Ready to try a gathering?</h3>
          <p>Start with a Pulse Pass or explore the Flow Membership for regular support.</p>
          <button class="primary-cta" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Contraindications</h3>
          <p class="muted">Sound gatherings are generally safe for most people. If you have uncontrolled epilepsy, recent head injury, pregnancy concerns, or are under acute psychiatric care, consult your medical provider before attending. If unsure, contact <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Gentle gatherings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a> · <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
